    <string name="proxy_desc">The catalog, sound and logos go through the proxy: this gets past networks that cut foreign servers. Use your VPN service\'s proxy, or an app on this phone such as ByeByeDPI, v2rayNG or Orbot (address 127.0.0.1, the port from its settings). The home network and Tailscale go direct.</string>
