    <string name="proxy_dpi_desc">ByeDPI is built into the app: it runs on the phone itself, with no server or VPN. It splits and disguises the start of each connection so the network cannot tell where it goes. It does not help everywhere: tap Find a way and the app tries its ways one by one.</string>
